<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 2-year note coupon falls to 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine 2-year note coupon falls to 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' fixed rate two-year notes fetched a lower coupon rate of 13.50 percent at the regular monthly auction on Tuesday from the previous 13.875 percent, the Bureau of Treasury said.</p>
</text>
